  "description": "<div>\n  <p>Repeatedly take the two heaviest entries from <code>stones</code>. If their weights are equal, discard both; otherwise discard the lighter one and replace the heavier with a stone weighing their difference. Return the final weight, or <code>0</code> if none remains.</p>\n  <p>A zero-weight stone is permitted and behaves just like any other entry. Process until fewer than two stones remain.</p>\n  <p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> stones = [2,7,4,1,8,1]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1</pre>\n  <p>Successive collisions leave one stone of weight 1.</p>\n  <p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> stones = [10,10]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 0</pre>\n  <p>Equal stones cancel one another.</p>\n  <p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n  <pre><strong>Input:</strong> stones = [5]\n<strong>Output:</strong> 5</pre>\n  <p>A lone stone stays unchanged.</p>\n  <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n  <ul>\n    <li><code>0 &lt;= stones.length &lt;= 1000</code>.</li>\n    <li><code>0 &lt;= stones[i] &lt;= 1000</code>.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
